{"title":"Giant Spider","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 8 Spider that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (7.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/giant-spider\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/giant-spider\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>8</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>26</td><td>8.9</td><td>400</td><td class=\"muted\">78 · 12.5 · 1,200</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>1</td><td>in the wilds around 1040, -56</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"spider-silk\" title=\"Spider Silk - in 100% of 4 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 9 total, 2–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0b2636b90d57ad14912f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Spider Silk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 4/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-small\" title=\"Mana Potion Small - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/4b59eb7c2796b5056c1b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Small</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"spider-silk\" title=\"Spider Silk - in 100% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 5 total, 5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0b2636b90d57ad14912f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Spider Silk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 4/4</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-4004.7px,-1948.0px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/14/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/14/8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:2048px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/15/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/15/8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:2048px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/16/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4096px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/16/8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4096px;top:2048px\"><i style=\"left:3927.2px;top:1925.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:3935.4px;top:1948.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:3983.8px;top:1937.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:4015.6px;top:1959.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:4054.4px;top:1940.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:3965.1px;top:1955.2px\"></i></div><figcaption>Sunken Trove</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1045, -52 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"giant-spider\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/18a260cc427b201aa0b5.webp\" alt=\"Giant Spider\"></div><h3>Giant Spider</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>8</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 8)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Spider</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>26</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>8.9</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>400</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>14 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}